      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A post office opened in 1900 inside Thomas Jones Dry Goods Store, with Colonel Magness’s grandson Thomas Morgan Waldrip as first postmaster.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
